{"channelId":"UCvlG9K55dALVRcZ8qh562Ag","row":["Woodfield Animal Sanctuary",12,"Welcome to our brand-new YouTube channel 👋\n\nWe’ve created this space to share longer videos, special moments, and behind-the-scenes footage from Woodfield Animal Sanctuary.\n\nOur main social media platform has always been Facebook, and that’s where we post the majority of our regular updates, news, and appeals. YouTube gives us the opportunity to bring you along in a different way — through video — while still keeping Facebook as the heart of our day-to-day communication.\n\nIf you’re new here, thank you for finding us.\nIf you already follow us on Facebook, welcome — and thank you for your continued support.\n\nBy liking, subscribing, and sharing our videos, you help us reach more people and continue giving animals the second chances they deserve.\n\nPLEASE VISIT OUR FACEBOOK PAGE FOR REGULAR UPDATES \nWOODFIELD ANIMAL SANCTUARY.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvlG9K55dALVRcZ8qh562Ag","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvlG9K55dALVRcZ8qh562Ag","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:11:53.167Z","channelId":"UCvlG9K55dALVRcZ8qh562Ag","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"92a443e9110a8daccc6c373a1731f6d964e0724ee675bcdbffc298640feb5aa6","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"e2b0d2c95ec7950970f9ad61b3b4a112149f4e68ada2436f12620600d4cc7282"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvlG9K55dALVRcZ8qh562Ag","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":12,"raw":"12 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvlG9K55dALVRcZ8qh562Ag","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:11:53.167Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"name_only","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"st